PSapvix28a81UsMOh_au5VD02xwT5jEcRUrZ8eYUOgB0zjj\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgOMf1b0m3MGXLPFUNkXBUQQ9P6nnwTeZGyO5qioarKWhc4T1pX3NL_U6k3kFTQKL9Q5TQ-bAHU3yM6xnCzdgrorQENsxX6eox2Dv2QSr3lGtZj2A2klwDVAWWBaUpiiOFt0It8E5tfaK-7rPSapvix28a81UsMOh_au5VD02xwT5jEcRUrZ8eYUOgB0zjj\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhATMdoN361PiG3KDN3WMYnDmiYLnSIfULKu7TFyUiRmcvjKHh1jLJa46ffyYlBf0MdJFk4MZndCDgjdHUnjCz00ceg95xnUzZIifs4fPWhqRraTZvXqE0JTH1psgE7T99J9I9tvh-neMFv9dV4PLf_uCobvDiLjpdKAebxTxbMJNeHDjozbEEOMfyol6c4\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhATMdoN361PiG3KDN3WMYnDmiYLnSIfULKu7TFyUiRmcvjKHh1jLJa46ffyYlBf0MdJFk4MZndCDgjdHUnjCz00ceg95xnUzZIifs4fPWhqRraTZvXqE0JTH1psgE7T99J9I9tvh-neMFv9dV4PLf_uCobvDiLjpdKAebxTxbMJNeHDjozbEEOMfyol6c4=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgXZemGF8W8hx8z2JiWcGdGRzHCqHFToswxkR7FUvFcCFMkzPoaxdh1Sm34OOIL1czjT_dKgu-mY-3dgBG2dbK1QrvrjYP209jfcWGLijn0aFVucurX2_qALQUCUjsf7QNZRgswQQsqhfRZRdmbOZa1Eiiz3s26K34AVIzp18102fcQCRv5vJ11ziI0s3mK\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgXZemGF8W8hx8z2JiWcGdGRzHCqHFToswxkR7FUvFcCFMkzPoaxdh1Sm34OOIL1czjT_dKgu-mY-3dgBG2dbK1QrvrjYP209jfcWGLijn0aFVucurX2_qALQUCUjsf7QNZRgswQQsqhfRZRdmbOZa1Eiiz3s26K34AVIzp18102fcQCRv5vJ11ziI0s3mK\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiYDyqYJhLS5E1NqxY88wcWIHmQQuACwDkZzFhNqlR5fk8I4b93wEGEUWquJOmE3Kh1j24PMxyWv9Mi9g47IdIyJqMPkUYFAt3QA-WB7NCmmQ_YMjomqc6D_FLZ74bz4gfLkzYR2nj3xhUn3p5v3SfftzEU5UJpYsz2pVQ8ygbacBpq0T9oNUX_S7vcXGbJ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiYDyqYJhLS5E1NqxY88wcWIHmQQuACwDkZzFhNqlR5fk8I4b93wEGEUWquJOmE3Kh1j24PMxyWv9Mi9g47IdIyJqMPkUYFAt3QA-WB7NCmmQ_YMjomqc6D_FLZ74bz4gfLkzYR2nj3xhUn3p5v3SfftzEU5UJpYsz2pVQ8ygbacBpq0T9oNUX_S7vcXGbJ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgzpvvUJqxK_c69Bgya26WNpYBPxqpy-HXg0vxKkx4PHd9EtvA7wvUWOfEu_2RaaX45wv1R0bgdSacryJcfbCwm3zVX3UGAwQAs31UPS4guMwwOedwz_p23QJp5OK4joWCV2IshjmF38hiKjJoVmFDGfA6Lr77AaX52Uiqf7g_YL0Pmoh93X7BbSPtcLFYF\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgzpvvUJqxK_c69Bgya26WNpYBPxqpy-HXg0vxKkx4PHd9EtvA7wvUWOfEu_2RaaX45wv1R0bgdSacryJcfbCwm3zVX3UGAwQAs31UPS4guMwwOedwz_p23QJp5OK4joWCV2IshjmF38hiKjJoVmFDGfA6Lr77AaX52Uiqf7g_YL0Pmoh93X7BbSPtcLFYF=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhY0USRWBU1glfLJ979CHyn6paiGQPmeTWBgkj-Mn3XoCiHWY3_yAbKze0frNwsB9yF4OljKLGGsvoGxeqac3n6DxKLDTdeJXaSyJEXgykJWvi7K3_r-anKI1M3CU5tWDyxG4jLWIvFTmuD9f7cbOI70RXs8xIaWGZILtudStNTXJIUgmYSrLQ5fZs2Y9eK\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhY0USRWBU1glfLJ979CHyn6paiGQPmeTWBgkj-Mn3XoCiHWY3_yAbKze0frNwsB9yF4OljKLGGsvoGxeqac3n6DxKLDTdeJXaSyJEXgykJWvi7K3_r-anKI1M3CU5tWDyxG4jLWIvFTmuD9f7cbOI70RXs8xIaWGZILtudStNTXJIUgmYSrLQ5fZs2Y9eK=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></div></div></div></span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">下半暝醒--來，輾來輾去無法度隨tńg去接sòa tú-chiah ê夢境--裡，tio̍h-ài求睏神來àⁿ--伊，引chhōa伊勻勻仔行入去眠夢ê連續劇戲文內底。劇情tng-leh播出，透早天拄拍phú光，是tng好眠ê時站，無張無tang</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">手機響--起-來，拍斷hit齣無頭無尾ê痟劇。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>In同事攑「酒任」ê手機khà--來，講工頭心臟ê問題，chit-má tī高雄義大病院急診，「你tio̍h緊落--來。」Kan-na問車坐到佗一站，抄張主任ê tsih接電話番，無khà kā問taⁿ情形按怎。規个人醒--起-來，chhoah膽緊mé款簡單包袱仔。Tio̍h坐高鐵khah緊，巷仔口有客運直達烏日站，目睭iáu sa-bui-sa-bui，車牌頂顯示頭幫車chōa 6:00，chit久5:10。翻頭倒tńg入厝內，睏神走--ah，頭殼lin-long-se̍h，theⁿ loeh膨椅，chiah知tio̍h-ài來祈禱，祈求上帝保守。目睭kheh-kheh想講，伊m̄知有偌嚴重，若照伊chit十外年來ê身體狀況，大常無啥要緊chiah tio̍h，祈求上帝來保庇chit个「古早人」、古意老實、khiû koh儉ê老人。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>台中、高雄有偌遠？Boeh去高雄ê阿蓮（A-lian）m̄是坐高鐵到左營，是坐到tī歸仁ê台南站，chiah盤一chōa 20 thóng分鐘ê客運就到位。坐高鐵雖然半票，khah緊到，m̄-koh儉底ê工頭為著省（séⁿ）車錢改坐火車，因為ē-tàng ù敬老卡拆車單。坐火車m̄-nā chhiân時間，盤車又koh赴bē著去郊區兩點鐘chiah有一幫ê客運，kan-na thōng tī路--裡就鎮掉歸半晡。若坐公路局客運，仝款thû時間。Kám講食老kan-na ē-sái提時間換現金？雖然手面趁食ê錢是靠儉--來--ê，m̄是趁--來--ê，m̄-koh有tang時仔儉無tī hia去，顛倒氣惱無khah-choa̍h！Kám講食老kan-na ē-tàng死儉？無錯，頭一个殘殘賣掉轎車，甘願ná無跤--leh，khah苦仔用時間換省金錢、儉老本。Sòa--loeh m̄買衫，橫直若無逼--到--著，絕對無愛khai錢，mài khai就是趁--著！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>來到ná像大賣場leh排擔仔位ê急診處，兩chōa護理站櫃台隔開兩大區，koh分做無仝症頭一loa̍h hoān一loa̍h，查埔、查某患者各一lông</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">，每一个床位頂koân有編號碼。先siòng看有伊--無？有ê thoah kha-tián遮--leh，巡se̍h一格過一格，陪伴tī患者床邊--ê chiâu是生疏kah生份ê下港人面容，只好翻頭問護理人員。In無閒taⁿ頭看--你，應講：「去掛號窗仔櫃台問」，kan-na照號碼就揣一廊過三廊chiah揣--著。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>人講：人一生就m̄-thang蹛入孤兒院、病院、法院、精神院、安養院chit五院。急診處boeh倚120頂病床，竟然空位無幾床，a̍h無tī偌好所在，m̄知啥症頭需要來掛急診，逐个m̄是theⁿ--leh就是倒--leh，一个一个吊大筒射，有ê目睭kheh-kheh，有ê睏kah ē kôⁿ。Kám是leh等報告thang決定是boeh轉去病房，iah是觀察半晡久，無koh-iūⁿ就thèng好出院？有ê兼罩sàng-sò͘，有ê鬥he測心臟跳動ê機械ti̍h-to̍k叫，有ê ná haiⁿ ná喘大khùi，有ê竟然烏白大聲jiáng，聽無伊是leh hiu啥貨。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>西醫系統就是完全靠檢查資料數字，除非有明顯外傷空喙，有tang時等檢查報告等規晡，查bē出啥原因。醫生無法度判斷，只好叫你tńg去歇睏，iah是另工chiah tńg來檢查別項，sòa接舞一百輾thàng ê結果mā是目睭金金人傷重。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>心電圖、電光、驗血ê相關初步檢查lóng總無問題，主治醫生先開寡藥仔講：「Ē-sái tńg去歇睏--ah。」病人、急診醫生、家屬、iah是公司同事koh有澄清病院主治醫生lóng ē想講，伊to有心臟問題，有裝『心律調整器』，既然檢驗數字無紅字，無代無誌tī歇睏時間ē起gông，gông kah péng腹想boeh吐，是m̄是其他老人症頭？就koh驗平衡方面ê頭殼耳鼻問題，mā是chhiau bē出原因。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>無想無量，20工後睏中晝也ē起gông，當然第一時間先送急診，通知家屬koh拚落去義大病院。人同事也無閒無工thang顧--伊。無khà款行李，熟路趕到位，看伊面色清幽，睏kah chiâⁿ落眠，無啥koh-iūⁿ，醫生講：「Kap頂改仝款，無要緊。」公司頭家kài體貼，交代伊緊mé tńg去台中koh再深入檢查，順sòa歇睏--幾-工，m̄知ē siuⁿ熱、siuⁿ忝--無？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>過15工仝款症頭koh 夯--起-來，同事、急診處、家屬lóng giâu疑，是tio̍h猴iah是kha̍h陰--neh？哪ē hiah-nī邪氣？看伊個外月就勞動三擺救護車，家己iáu m̄知檢討，kan-na無意無意、無pìⁿ步，是ke勞煩每一个關心--伊ê人。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>In三姊kan-na ē-hiáu講一寡無營養ê廢話，存心責備妗仔，開喙合喙就是庄跤查某人hit款m̄ bat字兼無衛生ê喙鼻。出一支喙牽拖東懷疑西，ke製造緊張niā-niā，完全無彩siâu。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>婦jîn人就thêng</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">環境致病因素，問伊ê房間設施，眠床、壁邊插座等等。原來伊睏ê所在頭殼頂面有插頭，伊ê手機lóng tī hia充電，揣著兇手--ah！了後chiah平安無事過日子。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>Kám講人古意老實是好欺負ê代名詞？Bē狡怪是hân-bān、無路用、低路師，病kah流油、古意kah跋跋--倒、老實kah擔屎bē-hiáu偷食。安份守己，bē phiⁿ--人、欠--人，bē-hiáu kâng欺，m̄ bat kâng騙，澈底就是hông食人夠夠--無-打-緊，根本是無才調保護家己，顛倒需要某囝來保護--伊。Koh-khah了然--ê是歹人看伊好欺負，soah來kāng伊ê某囝，che實在有夠冤枉kah死無人！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>人若是一个生活白痴，真正無藥醫，無智識mā ài有常識，連chit種chiah-nī簡單ê代誌，竟然碌死人！明明to暑假歇熱，稻仔收成ê 6月冬期間，哪ē是「落葉時雨」ê秋？</span></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">1「無張無tang」：無張無持ê意思。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">2「lông」：表示有舖排設備，tī頂面有囥mi̍h件iah是有人睏。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">3「thêng」：斟酌觀察ê動作，有研究ê成份。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" width=\"340\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #3778cd; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 377期，2025年8月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><p style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-align: left;\"></p><div align=\"center\" style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0px; position: relative;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></h3><h3 style=\"margin: 0px; position: relative; text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: medium; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration-line: none;\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration-line: none;\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\" style=\"color: #050505; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">#李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。  </span></div></div></div></div></span></div>"
